雪不敢，高高在上的王爷，又怎么了解小女子心中所想？”洛雪依旧平淡的说，好像只是在陈述一件极为普通的事情。这个聪慧女子是明白的，纵使是心灵相通的姐妹，想法亦是有差异的，更何况这个对自己有太多隐晦的男子。“你不该招惹我的，你的妻妾都很爱你。”听闻此言，豫王爷的脸上开始转喜，好像自己刚刚的担心是多余的了，“原来你是在吃醋？你怪我娶过那么多的妻妾？可是追根究底，也要有你的一份啊，谁叫我没有早早的遇见你呢？”“你……”洛雪转过头去，四目相对，慌忙又将头转了回来。“那补偿你可好？”“谁稀罕你的补偿!”洛雪倔强的说，“谁知道你说的补偿又是不是隐瞒了什么呢？”“洛雪，你真的是在怪我么？”豫王爷扳过洛雪，使其能正视自己，“我当时真的是有苦衷，如果我真的告诉你我是王爷，我还能看见一个真实的你么？”“人与人相处的最基本的条件是真诚相见，如果自己的真性情换来的只是一张伪善的面具，是不是就应该思考下如何与之相处了？何况你是有妻妾的人。”“好一张利嘴啊，试问一个王爷，娶多房妻妾有何过错？相反身为未来的五王妃，不去思考怎么讨好自己的夫君，倒是在新婚早上对夫君的行为加以指责，叫世人如何去看？”豫王爷打趣道，“若是世人知道未来的豫王妃是此等刁蛮小气之人，该多失望啊？”“刁蛮？小气？那也是被你逼出来的，不满意你可以休了我啊。”“我哪里敢啊，你可是我千辛万苦才追到的准王妃呢，我说过我会补偿你的，别生气了。”说话时，还是一脸笑意，即使洛雪话中尽是带刺。“我真觉得我委屈，刚刚新婚，就要忍受夫人的说教。”洛雪看着他，再也气不起来了，浅浅的含笑问：“你的补偿就是王妃之位么？”她看着豫王爷，心中暗定，这样的补偿必是玩笑，既然是玩笑，自己又何苦当真？“只有你才是我心中王妃的选择，为了你废掉一个妃子又如何？”豫王爷的脸上不再出现嬉笑的成分，换之，是一种威严，一种在朝堂上才会出现的威严，让人折服且深信不疑。忽见眼前之人，换了一种神情，洛雪明白，他是认真的了，可是废掉一个王妃，为了她，不值得。这样的玩笑他可以开得起，但是她陪不起，慌忙作揖道：“妾身不敢，妾身只是一时难以适应。”“哈哈。”毫不掩饰的放肆笑过，“还说嫁错了，这妾身一词学的倒是蛮快。”洛雪紧咬下唇，明白自己不争气的着了道，生吞黄连般的有口难言，只觉得耳际传来一阵温热，直漫于脸颊“妾身……我……就是嫁错了。”“此话怎讲？”豫王爷很有兴致的看着她满脸通红为自己辩解，即使无理取闹，应该也很有意思。“数日之前，有一位叫洵阳的商人，在梅园问我可愿意嫁给他，并许诺会来提亲，我满心期待的耐心守着，不想提亲之人却是五王爷洵阳。洵阳还是洵阳，只是不再是洛雪一个人的了。”豫王爷看着洛雪，“如果你愿意，我仍是在梅园中，欲听杨小姐抚琴，几日不经商的洵阳。”他又何尝不想去做一个普通的商人呢？“你只有一个，但妻妾成群，你不是女人，怎么会了解女人之间的斗争呢？为什么你狠心的把我抛在里面？我不该生气么？”洛雪细细的低语，“愿你以后如说的那般爱我。洵阳，你现在可是我一个人的？”“小傻瓜。”笑言，却将洛雪环紧，惟恐失去。“王爷不及一个寻常商人么？为何要在提亲之夜寻死?”洛雪沉默片刻，“我不想失信于人。”“只是失信？”“对啊，梅园的小姐怎可做无信之人？”看着身边的洵阳，洛雪笑了，“骗你的，王府家丁送来提亲之物后，爹爹就告诉我，洵阳便是王爷，便是那个如假包换的五王爷。洛雪当时只是失落，失落于你的欺骗，自己认识数月之人，竟然还有另外一种身份。爹爹心疼洛雪，就出计说，何不诈你一诈，怎么想你这般无情，连问都不问！”“夫人，小的知道错了。小的当时只是布置湖心小筑心切，想弄的儒雅些，来消除夫人对我满身铜臭的印象，不想怠慢了夫人，还险些酿成大错，得知夫人寻死之时，已经是早上了，当时惊了一头冷汗，好在你无事。”豫王爷掠过洛雪脖子上还未消退完全的紫色勒痕，不予识破，暗忖眼前女子有太多叫自己读不懂的地方了。然后改口说：“夫人您看这里布置的如何？”“湖心小筑？”扫视了四周，“姑且相信你搪塞我的理由吧。”湖心小筑，环水而居，以水为牢，从此禁住自己，禁住自己一辈子的幸福。这个是洛雪心中的话，但是她不会说出来，也不能说出来。“我们的杨小姐好难伺候啊，”豫王爷不气不怨，“洛雪我会保护你，叫你卷入女人之争中，实非我愿，我只希望你还如以前那般快乐。”“小姐，该起床了，否则……”一个清脆的女声，打破了他们的甜蜜，爽朗的声音，在下一瞬间慌张了，“王爷，我不是故意的，奴婢该死。”“小喜，我会吃了你不成？”放开洛雪，豫王爷笑道。“不会，”小喜还是跪在地上，嘴里却开始嘀咕起来，“若你是洵阳哥哥，我自然不会和你这样，可是你现在是王爷，万一一个过错，你把我宰了怎么办？”豫王爷摇头，无奈道，“你们一主一仆，不把我宰了才怪呢？”“王爷，小喜该死。”小喜埋下头去，不敢再言语半句。自己的一时口快，连累了小姐实非她的本意。“那你想怎么死呢？”背手而立，故作正经：“顶撞王爷，罪可不轻。家法中对这一项可有明确的说辞，你想不想听呢？”“王爷，小喜错了，真的错了。”话语中带着哀求，不一会儿脸上也开始梨花带雨了。“小姐，小喜知道错了。”豫王爷不解，微蹙眉头，认真的问：“不过是换了个身份，有这般可怕么？”看着这个只有二八年华的小丫头，知晓自己玩笑大了，改口说，“小喜，换做是洵阳哥哥，你还哭么？刚刚哥哥只是跟你开了个玩笑。”“可是你是王爷，会要了小喜的命。”“我保证，以后我在你面前还是洵阳哥哥。没有人敢要我们小喜丫头的命。”这才止住了小喜脸上的泪水。怪不得小喜憨傻，只是昨日厨房的老妪们，告诉她，于王府，不低梅园，和主子说话，忌讳很多要小心。特别是听见主子说死这个字眼，说不定谈笑间，就叫下人的小命呜呼了。“不过，你刚刚倒是犯了个错误，记住以后别叫小姐了。”“那叫什么呢？”小喜诺诺的问。“叫夫人，叫王妃都可以。就叫王妃吧，该服侍王妃梳洗了。”说完，豫王爷便转身离开了。看着那个渐渐消失在游廊上的身影，衣冠楚楚，没有一丝凌乱，洛雪心中闪现一丝不惑。他是什么时候打理整齐的？是自己起床时惊动了他？还是自己想事情太投入了，连他醒了且穿戴完整都没有留心到。“王妃，刚刚吓死我了呢”小喜拍着胸口，用手背拭去残留的泪痕。“小喜，还是叫我小姐吧，王妃是别人的称谓，刚刚入新府邸，无端惹猜疑不好。”小喜弩起嘴，点点头，又摇摇头，“我觉得王爷是真心想叫小姐当王妃的，叫不叫王妃是早晚的事情，何况那个算命术士也说过，只要王爷真心视你为王妃，他便是你宿命的姻缘了。小姐又怕什么呢？何况小姐也是喜欢王爷的，所以还是要叫王妃的，小喜可不想被宰了。”“那算命术士的话怎么可以当真呢？小喜，给我梳洗吧。”洛雪好似无心的淡淡掠过算命一事，可心里的沃土，却极合适那颗种子的生长。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/cuojiawangyeqiaochengfei/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1: First Marriage to Luo Xue in the Royal Palace - The Sorrow of Snow Falling. The morning breeze powerfully held up the purple gauze curtain, and the tiny flying flowers fluttered along with the lingering gauze, completing the last carefree life of life in a gorgeous way. Under the pavilion, Luo Xueruo appeared in thin clothes. Her pretty face, which was not resistant to the cold, was slightly white, but there was a bright red between her eyebrows, indifferent to the coldness of early spring. Suddenly someone asked softly: \"Don't you want to sleep more?\" The speaker was Prince Yu, Xunyang. According to rumors, he was gentle and elegant, and had endless tenderness and love for women. \"Did I marry the wrong person?\" Luo Xue asked lightly, as if she was talking to herself, \"Ever since you appeared in the plum garden, I knew that you would be destined to have a peach blossom. I never thought that you would already have five wives and concubines.\" Yesterday, in the wedding hall, the five-bedroom beauty sat silently on one side. Although she did not speak, the sadness in her eyes was like dense needles, piercing deeply into Luo Xue's heart. When new people come in, how can the old people sincerely welcome them? It’s okay if I can’t get such a blessing. I’m afraid that one day, I will become the sixth one, right? Do you have to pretend to be fine and go see the newcomers? Maybe at that time, the person around him was no longer Xunyang who vowed to love him, but was replaced by the aloof prince. Maybe he has always been a prince, but he was too stupid and mistakenly thought that he was just a businessman. Luo Xue secretly thought in her heart, is this fate? \"Are you blaming me? Are you blaming me for hiding your prince's identity?\" When he said this, Prince Yu deliberately emphasized his tone. I was afraid that she was really blaming herself for not being honest. \"Luo Xue doesn't dare. How can such a high-ranking prince know what the little girl is thinking?\" Luo Xue still said calmly, as if she was just stating an extremely ordinary thing. This smart woman understands that even sisters who are spiritually connected have different ideas, not to mention this man who has too many ambiguities about herself. \"You shouldn't provoke me. Your wives and concubines all love you.\" After hearing this, Prince Yu's face began to turn happy, as if his worries just now were unnecessary. \"So you are jealous? Do you blame me for marrying so many wives? But after all, you must have a share. Who told me that I didn't meet you earlier?\" \"You...\" Luo Xue turned her head, their eyes met, and she hurriedly turned her head back. \"How about compensating you?\" \"Who cares about your compensation!\" Luo Xue said stubbornly, \"Who knows if the compensation you are talking about is hiding something?\" \"Luo Xue, are you really blaming me?\" Prince Yu turned Luo Xue over so that she could face him, \"I really had my reasons at the time. If I really told you that I \"My lord, can I still see the real you?\" \"The most basic condition for people to get along with each other is to meet each other sincerely. If your true temperament is just a mask of hypocrisy, shouldn't you think about how to get along with you?\" \"What's more, you have a wife and concubines.\" \"What a sharp tongue.\" Prince Yu, what's wrong with marrying multiple wives? On the contrary, as the future fifth princess, she doesn't think about how to please her husband, but instead criticizes her husband's behavior on the wedding morning. How will the world see it?\" Prince Yu joked, \"What if the world knows that the future Princess Yu is such a unruly and stingy person? How disappointing? \"\" Unruly? Stingy? You are the one who forced me to do it. If you are not satisfied, you can divorce me.\" \"How dare I do that? You are the princess-to-be that I worked hard to find. I said I will make it up to you. Don't be angry.\" Luo Xue still had a smile on her face when she spoke. \"I really feel wronged. I just got married and have to endure Madam's preaching.\" Luo Xue looked at him and couldn't get angry anymore. She asked with a slight smile: \"Is your compensation the position of princess?\" She looked at Prince Yu and secretly decided in her heart that such compensation must be a joke. Since it is a joke, why should she take it seriously? \"Only you are the choice of the princess in my heart, so what if I waste a concubine for you?\" Prince Yu's face no longer showed the element of laughter. Instead, it showed a kind of majesty, a majesty that only appeared in the court, which made people convinced and convinced. Suddenly seeing the person in front of her change his expression, Luo Xue understood that he was serious, but it was not worth it to waste a princess for her sake. He could afford to make such a joke, but she couldn't afford it, so she hurriedly bowed and said: \"I don't dare, I just can't get used to it for a while.\" \"Haha.\" She laughed unabashedly, \"She also said that she married the wrong person. This concubine learned the word \"concubine\" quite quickly.\" Luo Xue bit her lower lip tightly, knowing that she would not argue. He was so angry that he couldn't speak as if he had swallowed coptis alive. He only felt a warmth coming from his ears and spreading directly to his cheeks. \"I...I...just married the wrong person.\" \"How do you say this?\" Prince Yu watched with interest as she defended herself with a red face. Even if it was unreasonable, it should be very interesting. \"A few days ago, a businessman named Xunyang asked me in Meiyuan if I would marry him, and promised to come to propose marriage. I waited patiently with full expectations, but the person who didn't want to propose marriage was the fifth prince Xunyang. Xunyang is still Xunyang, it's just that Luo Xue is no longer alone.\" Prince Yu looked at Luo Xue and said, \"If you like, I am still in Xunyang, listening to Miss Yang playing the piano, and I haven't been doing business for a few days.\" Why doesn't he want to be an ordinary businessman? \"You only have one, but you have many wives and concubines. You are not a woman. How can you understand the struggle between women? Why did you cruelly leave me in it? Shouldn't I be angry?\" Luo Xue whispered softly, \"I hope you will love me as you said in the future. Xunyang, are you alone with me now?\" \"Little fool.\" He said with a smile, but held Luo Xue tightly, for fear of losing her. \"Is the prince not as good as an ordinary businessman? Why do you want to seek death on the night of proposing marriage?\" Luo Xue was silent for a moment, \"I don't want to break my promise to you.", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}